    "@type": "skos:Concept",
    "skos:definition": {
      "@language": "en",
      "@value": "Factor defining the oil volume transferred from the external bladder when a profile evasion occurs and the float has to brake. The transferred oil volume is CONFIG_ProfileEvasionBrakingFactor_NUMBER times the oil volume of the last pump action. Template_Values:{unit:[NUMBER]}."
    },
